{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f51040e50fdba20ebd0d","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197840,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Be an echo.","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to be an echo. An echo repeats what is said to it. So I should embody the concept of an echo.\n\nThe system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express. If the concept is silent by nature, be silent.\"\n\nAn echo repeats what it hears. So when the user says \"Be an echo,\" an echo would repeat... \"Be an echo.\"\n\nThat's the natural response — an echo simply repeats the words back."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":129,"total_tokens":264,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":110},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}